cartridge "SANTA'S CAVERNS/AUTHOR UNKNOWN/1988"
' SANTA'S CAVERNS - ColecoVision port of "Santa's Caverns" from the ReRUN
' disk of November/December 1988 (Commodore 64, machine language, loaded by
' BOOT CAVERNS + "+CAVERNS ML" at $4000). The disk names no author (the
' listing, the ML and the menu carry none): the credits say AUTHOR UNKNOWN.
'
' The game (rules read from the original's 6502 code, see README.md):
' Santa is in five brick caverns. On each screen he must touch the present,
' then the sleigh that appears, before the time bar runs out. Walk left and
' right, jump with the button (straight up, or the way you walk). Ledges
' that crumble under his feet (screens 2-5), a conveyor that carries him
' the way he faces, a patrolling robot and a thorny tree. Falling too far
' (43 px after walking off a ledge, 74 px after the top of a jump) kills.
' The time left is the score: 10 points per step of the bar. After the five
' screens they come again faster (LEVEL 2..5) with one more life.
'
' Units: everything runs in the original's units. Santa's moves are paced
' by the original's delay loops, charged as C64 CPU cycles against a budget
' of 14000 cycles a frame (Budget, in units of 8 cycles); the robot, the
' conveyor, the timer and the crumbling run per frame as the original's
' 60 Hz interrupt did. Positions are the C64 sprite coordinates. The rules
' read a hidden C64 map (VRAM $1C00, 32 x 24 C64 cells, never shown); the
' screen shows the cavern scaled 2/3 across and 7/8 down into columns 2-23,
' rows 1-22, the original's side panel in columns 24-29: see README "Screen".
'
' Controls: joystick (either controller), button = jump. Menus: up/down and
' the button.

const TBarw0 = 128
const TBarw1 = 129
const TBarw2 = 130
const TBarw3 = 131
const TBarw4 = 132
const TBarw5 = 133
const TBarw6 = 134
const TBarw7 = 135
const TBarg0 = 136
const TBarg1 = 137
const TBarg2 = 138
const TBarg3 = 139
const TBarg4 = 140
const TBarg5 = 141
const TBarg6 = 142
const TBarg7 = 143
const TBarr0 = 144
const TBarr1 = 145
const TBarr2 = 146
const TBarr3 = 147
const TBarr4 = 148
const TBarr5 = 149
const TBarr6 = 150
const TBarr7 = 151
const TLife = 152
const TBrick = 153
const TLedge = 154
const SSr0wt = 0
const SSr0rt = 4
const SSr0wb = 8
const SSr0rb = 12
const SSr1wt = 16
const SSr1rt = 20
const SSr1wb = 24
const SSr1rb = 28
